LeRobot Lite is an independent, hardware-only derivative of Hugging Face LeRobot.
It is not an official Hugging Face or Seeed Studio package.

Vendored hardware code is from huggingface/lerobot v0.6.1:
commit 7e241bd630a3719a56157a497ce5d08f244784f1
