Changes: isolated package namespace, removed ML-adjacent import paths,
removed camera integration and device registries, replaced DeepDiff with
dictionary equality for flat control tables, and added a validated standard-
library calibration store and stricter public connection/action boundaries.
Motor normalization, encoding, register tables, configuration, calibration
procedure, and relative-target clipping are retained from the pinned source.
See upstream.lock.json and scripts/vendor_upstream.py for exact provenance.
